Package: com.551.obdelevenupdatebypass
Name: OBDeleven Update Bypass
Version: 1.0.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Bypasses the forced Update Required gate in regular OBDeleven 1.11.0 by spoofing the app version/build and x-mobile-app-version header. The spoofed app version can be changed from Settings without rebuilding the tweak.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), ellekit, preferenceloader
